  "exposed": {img:"☀️", ex5:[{t:1,en:"Don't stay exposed to the sun for too long.",kr:"햇빛에 너무 오래 노출되지 마."},{t:2,en:"The old wall was exposed to the rain.",kr:"낡은 벽이 비에 노출되어 있었어."},{t:3,en:"He was exposed to a new culture in London.",kr:"그는 런던에서 새로운 문화에 접하게 되었어."},{t:4,en:"The wires were exposed after the accident.",kr:"사고 후에 전선이 밖으로 드러났어."},{t:5,en:"Children shouldn't be exposed to scary movies.",kr:"아이들이 무서운 영화에 노출되어서는 안 돼."}]},
